nly when playing media. To do this, include this condition","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":true,"m_isOrCondition":false}],"m_description":"🔊 Fast media volume toggle for MacroDroid: mute media instantly and restore the previous volume with a single tap.\n-----\n⭐️ Main features:\n\n🔇 Mute media by holding the Volume Down button\n🔊 Restore the last saved volume by holding the Volume Up button\n💾 Automatically remembers the previous volume level\n📢 Displays the current status via notification\n⚡ Quick and convenient hardware button control\n🪶 Lightweight and battery-friendly\n-----\n⚙️ How it works: \n1. 🔇 Hold the Volume Down button to mute media. The current volume level is automatically saved. \n2. 🔊 Hold the Volume Up button to restore the previously saved volume level. \n3. 📢 A notification displays the current state after each action.","m_descriptionOpen":false,"m_enabled":false,"m_excludeLog":false,"m_headingColor":-11382190,"m_isOrCondition":false,"m_name":"Fast Media Vol. 🎚️","m_triggerList":[{"m_dontChangeVolume":true,"m_monitorOption":0,"m_notConfigured":false,"m_option":3,"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-4863750783480786641,"m_classType":"VolumeButtonTrigger","m_comment":"Turning off the sound","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"m_dontChangeVolume":true,"m_monitorOption":0,"m_notConfigured":false,"m_option":2,"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-7866750665241275029,"m_classType":"VolumeButtonTrigger","m_comment":"Turning on the sound","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false}]},"macroExportVersion":1}